# Keep every text file LF in the working tree on every platform. Ledger and
# contract tests hash checked-in files byte-for-byte, so a CRLF checkout
# (Windows git default core.autocrlf=true) made them fail (audit ARC-04/ARC-12).
* text=auto eol=lf
*.hwpx binary
*.hwp binary
*.png binary
*.pdf binary
